.9,"stats":{"hp":5200,"atk":210,"def":150,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"assault_arts_unit":{"slug":"assault_arts_unit","name":"Assault Arts Unit","icon":"/enemies-icons/Assault Arts Unit.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue staff components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Often malfunctions, but better than letting an Infected cast Arts with their bare hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","For a short time after activating their skills, Operators equipped with this deal additional Arts damage and inflict Frighten for a fixed duration when dealing damage","When equipped by enemies","Attacks by units equipped with this deal Arts damage; the first attack after pickup prevents the target from attacking or healing for a period of time","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"unequipped_blade":{"slug":"unequipped_blade","name":"Unequipped Blade","icon":"/enemies-icons/Unequipped Blade.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue weapon components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Unsafe to hold before assembly, but still more threatening than empty hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","Operators equipped with this gain increased ATK","When equipped by enemies","Units equipped with this gain increased ATK","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"armor_of_the_empire":{"slug":"armor_of_the_empire","name":"'Armor of the Empire'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Armor of the Empire'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Royal Guards who swore an oath of eternal loyalty to Victoria. In the King's memories, their steel bodies lined up to form mountains, and white steam covered the sky above.","abilities":["Locks onto an allied unit with the current highest HP, dealing Physical damage multiple times to it and the nearby unit with the current highest HP","Can perform long-ranged attacks","After several attacks, charges up for an attack that deals heavy damage 3 times"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":1020,"def":1800,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"millscar_elite_mercenary":{"slug":"millscar_elite_mercenary","name":"'Millscar' Elite Mercenary","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Millscar' Elite Mercenary.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A member of one of Londinium's underground insurgent forces and a seasoned mercenary, happy to snatch anything from debtors. No one who asked what turned them this way has lived to get an answer.","abilities":["Can equip gear, max 3 different types","When approaching other enemies equipped with gear, collects that gear if its type is not already being equipped, up to a max of 3 different types"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":19500,"atk":1420,"def":640,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.8}},"heavy_transport_vessel":{"slug":"heavy_transport_vessel","name":"Heavy Transport Vessel","icon":"/enemies-icons/Heavy Transport Vessel.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An experimental aircraft designed by the Industry Development Association for transporting goods. Other members wish their colleagues wouldn't entrust their dreams of flying to a cargo craft.","abilities":["Attacks hit 3 times","Deals a large amount of Physical damage to all units in a fixed range when defeated and drops random gear"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.2,"stats":{"hp":44000,"atk":950,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5.5}},"the_last_steam_knight":{"slug":"the_last_steam_knight","name":"'The Last Steam Knight'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'The Last Steam Knight'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Steam Knights are the pride of Victoria, her fist, her highest military honor. The last Steam Knight rises from sealed ruins, intent on defending the Victoria in his heart.","abilities":["Debut Phase","ATK and Movement Speed are reduced, but restored once [Pneumatic Pressurization] is triggered","First Form","[Pneumatic Pressurization] Gains increased ATK and Movement Speed and becomes immune to control effects; stuns self when effect expires","[Furious Defense] Charges up before attacking, dealing heavy damage 3 times","[Unto My Last Breath] Leaps into the air after losing a certain amount of HP, targeting your unit with highest max HP and dealing multiple Arts damage hits to the nearby unit with the highest HP percentage","Second Form","Has reduced DEF and RES","[Pneumatic Pressurization] becomes permanently active","[Unto My Last Breath] locks onto an additional target"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":65000,"atk":1600,"def":2000,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"alistair_final_flame_of_the_empire":{"slug":"alistair_final